docs/reported/saffron-static-ownership-residue.md

The `make-counter` closure env (32 bytes) has no static owner: a capturing
closure returned as `any` in a dynamic file.  A default build reclaims it --
the collector is a compiled Saffron program's allocator -- but this gate builds
Saffron with the collector off (TUR_SAFFRON_GC=0) to measure the static drops,
where it leaks by design.
